  "description": "Classic Rider is a bold vintage slab serif font inspired by classic Western, rodeo, college, and traditional American lettering. Its strong, rugged character makes it perfect for creating timeless designs with a nostalgic and adventurous feel.\nIdeal for logos, t-shirts, posters, badges, signage, labels, packaging, apparel, branding, stickers, and vintage-inspired craft projects.\nFont Style:\nVintage, Western, Retro, Slab Serif, Bold, Classic, Rustic, Americana\nPerfect For:\n– Western & cowboy designs\n– Rodeo and ranch branding\n– Vintage apparel\n– T-shirt designs\n– College-style graphics\n– Logos and badges\n– Posters and signs\n– Stickers and labels\n– Packaging\n– Cricut & Silhouette projects",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Classic Rider is a bold vintage slab serif font inspired by classic Western, rodeo, college, and traditional American lettering. Its strong, rugged character makes it perfect for creating timeless designs with a nostalgic and adventurous feel.</p>\n<p>Ideal for logos, t-shirts, posters, badges, signage, labels, packaging, apparel, branding, stickers, and vintage-inspired craft projects.</p>\n<p>Font Style:<br>\nVintage, Western, Retro, Slab Serif, Bold, Classic, Rustic, Americana</p>\n<p>Perfect For:</p>\n<p>– Western &amp; cowboy designs<br>\n– Rodeo and ranch branding<br>\n– Vintage apparel<br>\n– T-shirt designs<br>\n– College-style graphics<br>\n– Logos and badges<br>\n– Posters and signs<br>\n– Stickers and labels<br>\n– Packaging<br>\n– Cricut &amp; Silhouette projects</p>",
